            "description": "A second, unrelated account used by the Workspaces & RBAC folder to demonstrate membership and cross-tenant isolation. Must exist before 'Add member' - Phase 1 has no email-invite flow, only add-by-email-of-an-existing-account (docs/system-design.md section 15.2 note in relay_api/routers/workspaces.py)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('status is 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
